      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "By the way, I also prefer to polish the\r\nperformance rather than the appearance —what\r\npeople call \"substance\".",
        "Jp" : "ちなみに、オレも見た目より性能を\r\n磨き上げた方が好みだ\r\n――人でいうと、いわゆる\"中身\"だな"
