      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let's save this cake for a break at the workshop,\r\nas a pleasure to look forward to.\r\nToday seems like a good day to\r\nforge some fine armor.\r\nYes, indeed, it's truly motivating!",
        "Jp" : "このケーキ、工房での休憩のための\r\n楽しみとしてとっておこう\r\n今日は良い武具を鍛えられそうだ\r\nうむ、実に励みになる！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 750360,
      "MsgType" : 0,
